        },
        {
          "text": " Konyaraut Ipilisitian isasedotin ka ikaroak, kobalas ebe, “Kikwaikini ai asaduku naka EJAKAIT? Kitodikinai lukijukaria kaŋes aiboisike.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
