              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Tub 3:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kosodete kesi atemar ebe, “Inyoin eraun ainakinet naka aibucaret yenikinyakaria ŋes?” Kotemasi atiar, “Abusion akany nuka esabu, ka imirio ikany luka esabu, kwape eiaar etiai loka ijaka luka Ipilisitian: naarai adiopetular ajai mamakus kere ka ijakakus da. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
